  "game_version": "23661872",
  "author": "Prolution",
  "description": "Zombie mode has been rebuilt from scratch. This includes major balance and game play improvements. 2 new zombies, bringing the total to 6. Zombies are also now stronger. See the Change log and readme for more information on changes and how to play (its even easier)!\n\nIn order to play RUSE ZOMBIE MODE by Prolution:\n---\nMany options to play!\na). Play as or against Germany. Germany AI profile should be set to \"Zombie\". *V.2 Update: Germany now uses zombies in every time period.\nb). Multiplayer friendly, just make sure everyone has THIS mod installed.",
