    {
      "dat": "Data/PC/190852/ZZ_Win.dat",
      "dic": "genlocalisation/ww2/localisation/translations/us/long_description_unite.dic",
      "entries": [
        {
          "key": "6a6ec6349de3b91b",
          "value": "Unlike the lumbering hordes of reanimated corpses that walk the Earth, the Ghost is a spectral entity, bound to the mortal realm by some malevolent force. It drifts silently through the shadows and strikes from the ethereal plane, making it almost impossible to detect until it's too late. ",
          "add": true
        },
        {
          "key": "eaeee6e67cab796c",
          "value": "~TOP SECRET REPORT~ Scattered sightings throughout occupied Europe warn of a new threat. Hordes of the undead engorged into giant lumbering undead colossals. Neither planes nor the strongest prototype vehicles are safe from them, not even at extreme ranges. General, consider a nuclear alternative. ",
          "add": true
        },
        {
          "key": "2a6eaa6deef2f06c",
          "value": "This zombie brute has enhanced power and dexterity. It can destroy a medium tank with ease, but is vulnerable to air-attack.",
          "add": true
        },
        {
          "key": "be7c9baa7bcaf47f",
          "value": "Late in the war, Nazi scientists discovered the power to raise the dead. Hoping to use this super weapon to win the ultimate victory; instead, they created something far more terrible. Now, the undead walk the Earth and must either be put down or else all will join the ranks of their zombie army.",
          "add": true
        },
        {
          "key": "0000000000000080",
          "value": " etainroshldmcugfpywb,v.k'-TAIS10M25q743xzB()FPGLWC98H E6RUD\"Vj«»K/:JON;…!ZQYöä~%°ü&\néôū"
        },
        {
          "key": "b5aabee66cb6f9ad",
          "value": "A specially designed zombie with attuned reconaissance senses and speed abilities. They can smell you before you see them and run faster than a jeep. Destroying them is a priority, else they will surround and zombify your base.",
          "add": true
        },
        {
          "key": "fe6de2b7baa726ae",
          "value": "The Spitter hurls toxic bile at its prey with eerie accuracy, corroding everything in its path. This vile projectile can melt through metal, making the Spitter a dangerous adversary.",
          "add": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}